# Public provider artifacts carry SHA-256 pins over these exact source bytes.
# Windows checkouts must preserve the same LF bytes used by release/SDK checks.
# Runtime manifests, JSON imports, presentation CSS and JavaScript enter
# verified application ZIPs as physical bytes; Git autocrlf cannot change them.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
